  "details": "VRChat is working on a new feature for the Worlds SDK titled \"Example Central.\" The feature is not finished yet and may change before the final release.\n\n- Examples Central gives World creators access to a variety of SDK examples. You can browse the list of examples or use the search. \n\n- The initial examples focus on Persistence and the Creator Economy.\n\n- Example Central makes it easier for VRChat to release new examples without updating the SDK.\n\n- Examples are easy to import into your project.\n\n- Each example comes with documentation on ask.vrchat.com to learn more or to discuss the example with other creators.",
